WEBVTT

01:29.700 --> 01:31.620
[Blood River]

01:31.620 --> 01:33.980
[Based on the novel of the same name from Zhou Munan's Youth in Jianghu series]

01:33.980 --> 01:35.980
[Available on fanqienovel.com & bkneng.com]

01:36.380 --> 01:38.980
[Episode 12]

01:40.670 --> 01:42.100
Master,

01:42.560 --> 01:43.740
are you serious?

01:43.950 --> 01:44.800
Kill them!

01:45.000 --> 01:45.800
End it once and for all.

01:45.800 --> 01:46.820
We won't even own up!

01:47.430 --> 01:48.130
As you command.

01:55.000 --> 01:56.100
So, are you two

01:56.870 --> 01:59.740
Su Changhe,

02:00.150 --> 02:02.180
the current Patriarch of Blood River,

02:03.280 --> 02:06.340
and Su Muyu, the head of the Su family?

02:08.510 --> 02:09.620
This is interesting.

02:10.710 --> 02:11.770
I know about you two.

02:12.710 --> 02:14.180
So, the current Blood River

02:14.600 --> 02:17.090
is led by two Nameless, huh?

02:17.640 --> 02:19.620
How did you guys manage to achieve that?

02:21.390 --> 02:22.650
This has nothing to do

02:23.440 --> 02:24.420
with our trip here.

02:27.830 --> 02:29.620
You actually utter such preposterous words

02:29.670 --> 02:31.140
at Yellow Springs Pawnshop?

02:31.950 --> 02:32.650
I can see why

02:33.110 --> 02:35.140
you were a former Kui.

02:37.880 --> 02:38.900
Kui

02:40.160 --> 02:41.370
is a monster among men.

02:43.950 --> 02:45.370
We travel on the same path.

02:55.790 --> 02:57.060
So, you're the owner of Yellow Springs Pawnshop.

02:58.510 --> 03:00.210
Please don't say something like that.

03:00.880 --> 03:01.460
I am

03:01.830 --> 03:03.530
but an accountant.

03:04.160 --> 03:05.810
I'm not the owner

03:05.810 --> 03:06.740
of the shop.

03:07.520 --> 03:09.420
You guys can view all the items you want.

03:10.080 --> 03:11.300
But please don't land me in trouble.

03:12.080 --> 03:12.690
We dare not do so.

03:13.440 --> 03:14.420
Your words are too heavy, shopkeeper.

03:15.790 --> 03:16.860
Let's not waste any time, then.

03:18.160 --> 03:19.690
Take us to

03:20.040 --> 03:21.180
the treasures of Blood River.

03:32.710 --> 03:33.690
It's been so long

03:34.320 --> 03:35.590
since anyone

03:35.640 --> 03:36.740
has visited that place.

03:39.040 --> 03:39.860
Follow me.

04:44.440 --> 04:45.100
This is the place.

04:45.640 --> 04:47.010
The Yellow Springs Pawnshop

04:47.270 --> 04:49.010
serves everyone in the martial world.

04:49.710 --> 04:51.860
All clans have their treasures deposited in this place.

04:52.590 --> 04:53.130
This is

04:53.710 --> 04:55.570
the treasury of Blood River.

04:56.230 --> 04:56.890
I have a question.

04:57.590 --> 04:58.620
Even if we don't have this key,

04:59.350 --> 05:00.540
we can get in easily by scaling the wall.

05:04.350 --> 05:06.180
You think you can get in by scaling the wall?

05:06.760 --> 05:07.570
Trust me.

05:08.350 --> 05:10.620
There's no way you can leave in one piece

05:11.080 --> 05:13.660
even if you're the Patriarch.

05:14.710 --> 05:17.220
The Blood River's Spider's Nest...

05:17.440 --> 05:18.330
So, you know about that?

05:19.350 --> 05:20.330
It's nothing compared to the security here.

05:21.120 --> 05:22.220
It's utterly inferior.

05:27.240 --> 05:28.370
When you unlock the gate

05:28.390 --> 05:29.780
with this key,

05:32.710 --> 05:34.810
all the traps and arrays

05:35.320 --> 05:36.860
will be dispelled.

05:53.560 --> 05:53.980
Here.

05:54.880 --> 05:56.180
Keep the key.

05:57.350 --> 05:58.740
After this, you'll understand

05:59.640 --> 06:00.450
how precious

06:00.950 --> 06:02.690
this key is.

06:05.150 --> 06:05.450
All right.

06:30.880 --> 06:32.010
Is this Blood River's treasury?

06:32.590 --> 06:34.570
Let me show you the unrefined treasures first.

06:39.440 --> 06:41.250
How many people do they have to assassinate

06:42.030 --> 06:43.420
for them to gather this amount of wealth?

06:59.470 --> 07:00.490
Do the gold bricks here

07:00.510 --> 07:01.100
look a lot to you?

07:03.080 --> 07:04.250
Can you try to understand

07:04.270 --> 07:05.130
the sufferings of the world for once?

07:05.830 --> 07:07.100
Even if I combine the chest of silver taels

07:07.560 --> 07:08.980
and the residence I own,

07:09.590 --> 07:11.130
it's not even worth as much as this chest.

07:11.950 --> 07:12.860
To think that this room

07:13.270 --> 07:14.660
is filled to the brim with such gold bricks.

07:18.710 --> 07:19.540
I understand now.

07:21.270 --> 07:22.420
Blood River has stored all of their wealth

07:22.880 --> 07:23.890
in this treasury.

07:24.710 --> 07:26.660
If you think that's the only thing they stored here,

07:27.760 --> 07:29.680
Master Su, you're underestimating

07:29.710 --> 07:31.100
your Blood River predecessors.

07:31.590 --> 07:32.300
Follow me.

07:51.510 --> 07:52.300
Calm down.

07:52.830 --> 07:53.860
There's no one inside.

07:55.510 --> 07:56.780
But I feel sword qi inside.

07:57.440 --> 07:57.930
This sword

07:58.760 --> 07:59.810
is from the Sword Heart Tomb.

08:00.350 --> 08:01.220
Follow me.

08:02.710 --> 08:03.370
The Sword Heart Tomb,

08:03.830 --> 08:04.890
the Villa of Famed Swords,

08:05.390 --> 08:07.370
and the No-Sword City, which had been eradicated,

08:08.270 --> 08:09.490
most of the famed swords stored here

08:09.760 --> 08:12.250
all came from those three places.

08:13.680 --> 08:14.690
Look over there.

08:15.440 --> 08:16.180
The armors,

08:17.080 --> 08:17.810
the long sabers,

08:18.120 --> 08:18.890
and the bows and crossbows,

08:20.080 --> 08:22.330
they were also created by

08:22.350 --> 08:23.810
the famous Lu Clan of Shanbei.

08:29.830 --> 08:31.330
Now, look at the Overlord Armor.

08:32.470 --> 08:33.500
The world thought

08:34.350 --> 08:36.140
that the Mu family had the only one of its kind.

08:39.320 --> 08:40.690
In reality, Blood River

08:40.920 --> 08:42.730
has the exact same set.

08:45.870 --> 08:46.570
This room

08:47.520 --> 08:49.060
is more valuable than the gold room.

08:51.320 --> 08:53.900
If you view it from a monetary perspective,

08:54.470 --> 08:55.660
naturally, this room

08:55.680 --> 08:57.210
isn't as valuable as the room filled with gold bricks.

08:57.800 --> 08:59.210
However, most of the weapons

08:59.710 --> 09:01.730
couldn't even be bought with money.

09:02.230 --> 09:02.730
Any one of them

09:03.160 --> 09:04.210
is rare enough

09:04.630 --> 09:06.140
that the martial world will kill

09:06.520 --> 09:07.970
just to get their hands on them.

09:08.920 --> 09:09.930
Shopkeeper Wang,

09:10.680 --> 09:12.210
why are you feeling proud about it?

09:13.750 --> 09:14.450
All of them belonged

09:14.470 --> 09:15.210
to our organization, you know?

09:17.200 --> 09:17.850
Ah.

09:18.200 --> 09:19.090
I suppose I was too used to it.

09:19.680 --> 09:21.180
Let's check out the remaining rooms.

09:22.830 --> 09:23.570
After this,

09:24.110 --> 09:25.540
you guys have to practice caution.

09:52.580 --> 09:55.140
[Cosmic Duality]

09:56.740 --> 09:59.620
[Drums and Thunder Gate]

10:03.160 --> 10:04.420
I once joined Lei Qianting of the Lei Clan

10:04.520 --> 10:05.210
to fend off

10:05.350 --> 10:07.060
Ye Dingzhi's Killing Array.

10:07.680 --> 10:08.450
He once mentioned

10:09.110 --> 10:10.380
these names to me before.

10:11.080 --> 10:11.930
All of these are

10:11.950 --> 10:12.930
the strongest gunpowder in the Lei Clan.

10:14.230 --> 10:15.420
I never expected Blood River

10:17.160 --> 10:17.730
to possess

10:17.750 --> 10:18.900
the gunpowder of the Lei Clan.

10:19.520 --> 10:21.730
This room is filled with all of them

10:22.680 --> 10:24.730
except for Kirin Fire Tooth,

10:25.110 --> 10:25.810
which is

10:26.350 --> 10:27.450
a top-tier gunpowder of the Lei Clan.

10:28.230 --> 10:29.570
Therefore, you have to be extra careful

10:29.800 --> 10:31.300
when unlocking this gate.

10:32.560 --> 10:33.730
Its walls

10:34.230 --> 10:35.300
and the gate itself

10:35.870 --> 10:38.850
were forged with Liuhe Steel.

10:39.870 --> 10:40.660
If not,

10:41.800 --> 10:42.730
if the gunpowder inside

10:43.110 --> 10:44.210
ignites at the same time by accident,

10:45.280 --> 10:46.730
the entire pawnshop

10:47.320 --> 10:49.900
will be levelled.

10:50.920 --> 10:52.140
You have to be careful

10:52.680 --> 10:53.500
when unlocking the next gate as well.

10:54.230 --> 10:55.300
If you're careless,

10:55.990 --> 10:56.690
the three of us

10:57.110 --> 10:58.330
will be buried here.

10:59.680 --> 11:00.450
That room

11:00.470 --> 11:01.930
is filled with all sorts of mystical poison.

11:02.830 --> 11:04.060
The Slumbering Serpent King

11:04.470 --> 11:05.970
can also be found within.

11:07.350 --> 11:08.810
It was reared with the deadly poison

11:09.280 --> 11:11.570
used by families such as the Wen family

11:11.590 --> 11:12.850
and the Tang Clan.

11:13.350 --> 11:14.900
Right now, this serpent

11:16.630 --> 11:17.900
is filled with deadly poison

11:18.110 --> 11:20.730
that has no cure.

11:21.440 --> 11:22.900
A single drop of its blood

11:23.680 --> 11:25.540
could easily topple the strongest of

11:25.680 --> 11:26.660
Heaven-level martial artists

11:27.200 --> 11:29.970
who had 30 years of cultivation.

11:31.080 --> 11:32.260
If I'm not mistaken,

11:33.350 --> 11:34.380
the last room

11:35.230 --> 11:36.810
should contain all sorts of hidden weapons.

11:40.280 --> 11:41.210
You're very smart.

11:41.830 --> 11:43.380
If we take them to Blood River,

11:46.990 --> 11:48.970
Blood River can turn into a full army anytime.

11:49.800 --> 11:51.570
It'll be the strongest army in the world.

11:52.520 --> 11:53.610
No one will be able to stop us.

11:54.560 --> 11:55.570
Monsters will be slain.

12:00.950 --> 12:01.780
Even deities

12:02.710 --> 12:03.690
will be slain.

12:05.520 --> 12:06.540
No wonder this sword

12:07.400 --> 12:08.500
could cause such a huge commotion.

12:10.560 --> 12:11.610
However, this is a pawnshop.

12:11.990 --> 12:12.730
It's not a money house.

12:14.520 --> 12:15.180
Smart boy.

12:16.230 --> 12:16.930
Plenty of people

12:17.080 --> 12:18.730
would've leapt out of joy

12:19.750 --> 12:20.570
upon seeing

12:20.630 --> 12:21.970
all the treasures here.

12:22.400 --> 12:23.450
No one would care about

12:23.520 --> 12:24.500
the details.

12:24.800 --> 12:25.570
Since it's a pawnshop,

12:26.800 --> 12:27.380
that means

12:27.400 --> 12:28.420
we have to pay a price

12:28.710 --> 12:29.900
in order to obtain all these treasures.

12:30.750 --> 12:31.780
What's the price we have to pay?

12:32.470 --> 12:33.690
There's no price for you two to pay.

12:34.400 --> 12:35.180
At least

12:35.560 --> 12:37.500
my pawnshop doesn't need anything from you two

12:38.320 --> 12:39.570
at the moment.

12:40.990 --> 12:41.540
I don't trust you.

12:43.810 --> 12:44.610
No need to be distrustful.

12:45.590 --> 12:46.850
Actually, you guys had started

12:48.230 --> 12:49.300
to pay the price

12:49.320 --> 12:50.610
long ago.

12:51.630 --> 12:52.540
The people you'd killed

12:52.920 --> 12:53.730
and the missions

12:53.990 --> 12:54.660
you'd completed

12:55.750 --> 12:57.180
were the price you paid

12:57.200 --> 12:58.450
to possess these treasures.

12:59.590 --> 13:00.140
After all,

13:01.160 --> 13:03.420
half of the missions you took on

13:04.200 --> 13:05.540
were assigned

13:06.440 --> 13:07.420
by us.

13:11.680 --> 13:12.970
Three Officials,

13:13.320 --> 13:14.180
you may stop hiding.

13:14.630 --> 13:16.020
We shall not do anything reckless

13:16.200 --> 13:18.330
within the Yellow Springs Pawnshop.

13:20.630 --> 13:21.540
Back then, Soul Reapers' Hall

13:21.560 --> 13:22.540
[Earth Official, Soul Reapers' Hall]
had an audience with you two.

13:23.470 --> 13:25.500
I said that we should've eliminated both of you.

13:27.160 --> 13:28.090
However, I also said

13:29.800 --> 13:31.260
that the danger of their existence

13:31.750 --> 13:32.540
was precisely why

13:32.560 --> 13:33.810
we need to keep them alive.

13:34.470 --> 13:36.210
Judging from the final result,

13:36.830 --> 13:38.420
perhaps eliminating them back then

13:38.800 --> 13:40.540
[Heaven Official, Soul Reapers' Hall]
was the best choice.

13:40.920 --> 13:42.020
We've been expecting you all.

13:42.750 --> 13:44.300
We've seen the treasures of Blood River

13:44.320 --> 13:45.380
and encounter you guys here.

13:46.280 --> 13:48.060
Our trip wasn't in vain.

14:02.520 --> 14:03.180
Hell Palm?

14:03.890 --> 14:04.490
Let's retreat!

14:09.410 --> 14:10.460
No one can master

14:10.830 --> 14:12.660
such a technique overnight.

14:13.320 --> 14:14.730
You cultivated it in secret long ago.

14:16.450 --> 14:17.500
You guys'd better hurry

14:17.560 --> 14:18.690
and put a hit on me.

14:20.590 --> 14:21.610
Let's see

14:22.280 --> 14:23.730
who else will obey your command.

14:24.590 --> 14:26.090
The Yellow Springs Pawnshop

14:26.800 --> 14:28.570
isn't a duel arena.

14:29.440 --> 14:30.210
Don't worry.

14:30.750 --> 14:31.970
We didn't come here

14:32.520 --> 14:34.090
to fight.

14:35.590 --> 14:36.450
Shopkeeper Wang,

14:37.050 --> 14:38.450
I'm afraid you haven't delivered

14:38.920 --> 14:40.970
the entirety of your message yet.

14:43.870 --> 14:44.730
You see, you guys appeared

14:44.800 --> 14:45.500
in the middle

14:45.560 --> 14:46.420
of our conversation.

14:48.440 --> 14:49.180
Patriarch,

14:49.800 --> 14:51.180
let me finish our conversation.

14:52.040 --> 14:53.570
The key you're holding

14:54.200 --> 14:55.260
can only

14:55.280 --> 14:56.450
unlock the rooms.

14:57.110 --> 14:59.090
You need another token

14:59.800 --> 15:01.420
if you wish to retrieve the treasures inside.

15:02.400 --> 15:03.140
What token?

15:04.230 --> 15:04.900
It's this.

15:04.900 --> 15:05.460
[Yellow Springs]

15:06.630 --> 15:07.450
That's the token.

15:08.440 --> 15:09.090
You may unlock

15:09.630 --> 15:11.210
the room with the key.

15:11.590 --> 15:12.810
And, you may retrieve the treasures inside

15:13.160 --> 15:15.090
with the token.

15:15.830 --> 15:18.090
Both are essential if you wish to retrieve the treasures.

15:20.440 --> 15:22.090
No wonder the Three Officials of Soul Reapers' Hall

15:22.280 --> 15:23.380
could always

15:23.400 --> 15:24.500
command the Three Families around.

15:30.520 --> 15:32.090
I know what you're thinking.

15:33.160 --> 15:33.730
You're thinking

15:34.520 --> 15:35.730
that you should kill us

15:35.750 --> 15:36.660
and steal the token

15:37.040 --> 15:38.300
while the Yellow Springs Pawnshop

15:38.870 --> 15:40.450
can't react in time.

15:41.590 --> 15:42.450
Or,

15:43.040 --> 15:43.780
you would kill us

15:44.400 --> 15:45.900
and Shopkeeper Wang.

15:51.630 --> 15:54.210
If anyone dares to fight here,

15:54.750 --> 15:56.300
the guns

15:56.470 --> 15:57.970
and mechanisms here

15:58.400 --> 16:00.180
aren't just for show, you know?

16:03.710 --> 16:05.690
I just need to press a button,

16:06.440 --> 16:08.180
and the treasures of Blood River

16:08.280 --> 16:10.050
will be reduced to ashes.

16:10.080 --> 16:11.300
All of your efforts will go down the drain.

16:13.110 --> 16:13.730
Everyone,

16:14.990 --> 16:16.140
please consider this

16:17.080 --> 16:18.730
carefully.

16:25.750 --> 16:26.540
Three Officials,

16:27.470 --> 16:28.500
could it be that you all

16:28.520 --> 16:29.380
have acknowledged me and Su Muyu

16:29.400 --> 16:30.420
as the leaders of Blood River?

16:32.590 --> 16:33.900
What do you think?

16:40.520 --> 16:41.780
You guys neglected one thing.

16:43.110 --> 16:43.810
What is it?

16:44.520 --> 16:46.020
We do not acknowledge the Soul Reapers' Hall.

16:47.080 --> 16:47.730
And, we will stop acknowledging

16:47.750 --> 16:48.570
the existence of the Three Officials.

16:54.800 --> 16:55.810
You guys won't be included

16:57.830 --> 16:58.730
in the new Blood River.

17:02.920 --> 17:04.700
It seems we thought too highly of ourselves.

17:05.430 --> 17:06.330
However, don't you guys think

17:07.390 --> 17:08.260
that

17:08.280 --> 17:09.740
you're oversimplifying things here?

17:12.870 --> 17:13.980
This is an invitation.

17:17.190 --> 17:18.220
Could it be that one of you

17:18.280 --> 17:19.460
is getting married?

17:20.430 --> 17:21.700
Is this a wedding banquet invitation?

17:23.720 --> 17:25.260
You guys said you wanted an answer

17:25.960 --> 17:27.740
and you wish to form a new Blood River.

17:28.190 --> 17:28.850
If so,

17:29.480 --> 17:30.610
you guys need to see

17:31.410 --> 17:32.570
the man stated in the invitation.

17:33.080 --> 17:34.130
What we wish to form

17:34.910 --> 17:36.220
has nothing to do with other people.

17:37.720 --> 17:38.460
So naive.

17:39.590 --> 17:41.460
As long as that individual in Tianqi City wishes so,

17:41.720 --> 17:42.260
he can

17:43.190 --> 17:44.940
obliterate all of the treasures here

17:45.390 --> 17:46.330
with just one thought of his.

17:47.150 --> 17:47.810
I assume

17:48.630 --> 17:49.570
you guys are in need

17:49.590 --> 17:50.460
of the treasures here.

17:54.830 --> 17:56.060
Who's that individual?

17:56.720 --> 17:57.890
The ancestors of said person

17:58.240 --> 17:59.780
formed Blood River 100 years ago.

18:00.590 --> 18:01.500
As for the rest,

18:01.910 --> 18:03.460
you guys will find out

18:03.870 --> 18:05.090
once you arrive at Tianqi City.

18:06.870 --> 18:08.540
Keep your Hell Palm in reserve.

18:09.520 --> 18:11.170
To kill in the Yellow Springs Pawnshop...

18:11.800 --> 18:13.060
Only a lunatic like you

18:13.080 --> 18:14.090
would try something like that.

18:21.830 --> 18:22.980
You were right.

18:24.040 --> 18:25.130
They would find us

18:25.520 --> 18:26.740
even if we didn't do anything.

18:29.000 --> 18:30.260
If so, let's follow their will

18:31.520 --> 18:33.060
and head to Tianqi City.

18:37.390 --> 18:38.260
Let's return to Blood River,

18:39.040 --> 18:40.090
summon the heads of the Three Families,

18:40.110 --> 18:40.810
gather our elite forces,

18:40.830 --> 18:41.500
and storm Tianqi City.

18:42.720 --> 18:43.410
Negotiate a deal, huh?

18:43.960 --> 18:45.020
Who wants to negotiate a deal with them?

18:45.800 --> 18:46.700
What a joke.

18:48.830 --> 18:49.810
This is a game of chess.

18:50.830 --> 18:52.220
If we use all of our pieces from the start,

18:52.910 --> 18:53.940
we'll lose the upper hand.

18:55.480 --> 18:56.300
You do have a point.

18:56.830 --> 18:58.170
They think that we'll follow their will blindly.

18:58.630 --> 18:59.940
They're underestimating us.

19:00.720 --> 19:02.410
Therefore, right now, we have to make it as if

19:02.760 --> 19:03.940
we kept the appointment

19:04.320 --> 19:05.220
but didn't at the same time.

19:05.960 --> 19:06.610
Indeed.

19:07.670 --> 19:08.260
Therefore,

19:09.390 --> 19:10.130
I shall head there alone.

19:10.590 --> 19:11.570
You shall enter the fray alone.

19:11.760 --> 19:12.810
I shall join the fray after that

19:13.240 --> 19:14.540
and launch a surprise attack.

19:15.240 --> 19:16.060
Return to Blood River.

19:16.870 --> 19:18.220
I shall deliver the intel I gathered

19:18.240 --> 19:19.780
at Tianqi City to you.

19:20.430 --> 19:21.780
We need to form a foolproof plan.

19:22.280 --> 19:23.740
Cross Blood River and you reach the Other Shore.

19:24.480 --> 19:25.570
This should be

19:26.190 --> 19:26.810
the last obstacle

19:26.830 --> 19:27.780
in our way.

19:37.060 --> 19:41.300
[Su Muyu of Blood River has entered Tianqi alone]

19:48.960 --> 19:50.170
Only one of them is here, huh?

19:51.430 --> 19:51.940
That's right.

19:52.960 --> 19:53.650
He and his sword

19:54.150 --> 19:54.980
are on their way.

19:59.060 --> 20:07.300
[Tianqi]

20:07.300 --> 20:10.900
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

20:12.190 --> 20:13.300
[Tianqi]
Tianqi City.

20:16.620 --> 20:20.460
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

20:20.630 --> 20:22.410
Father, I want that.

20:23.520 --> 20:24.500
You should stop eating.

20:24.800 --> 20:26.060
Buy it for me.

20:26.080 --> 20:26.940
No.

20:27.190 --> 20:28.020
Buy it for me.

20:28.320 --> 20:29.020
Be a good boy.

20:29.280 --> 20:30.850
I want that.

20:31.800 --> 20:33.090
You'll have a tooth ache if you eat that.

20:33.350 --> 20:33.890
I want it.

20:33.910 --> 20:35.020
I want it.

20:35.590 --> 20:37.570
Buy it for me.

20:37.590 --> 20:38.460
No.

20:39.190 --> 20:41.220
Naughty Father.

20:41.320 --> 20:43.130
Father, please buy it for me.

20:43.150 --> 20:44.020
No.

20:44.040 --> 20:46.020
Father, buy it for me.

20:47.280 --> 20:48.090
Fine.

20:48.320 --> 20:49.540
I'll buy it for you.

20:52.080 --> 20:52.700
Mister,

20:52.910 --> 20:53.370
why don't you take a look?

20:53.390 --> 20:54.020
Father.

20:54.320 --> 20:55.700
Tianqi City is so lively.

20:56.110 --> 20:57.890
[Chongzhen Gate]
It's much more livelier than No-Sword City.

20:58.560 --> 21:00.570
Tianqi City is the first among the Four Great Cities.

21:00.960 --> 21:02.300
It's bustling with life and prosperity.

21:02.720 --> 21:03.650
Naturally, our city

21:03.670 --> 21:04.460
cannot compare to it.

21:05.870 --> 21:06.500
So, where are we

21:06.520 --> 21:07.410
heading today?

21:09.190 --> 21:10.850
The Imperial Astronomical Bureau is located at the east.

21:11.320 --> 21:13.060
The astrologists there could pluck the stars with their hands

21:13.240 --> 21:13.940
and tell one's fortune.

21:14.520 --> 21:15.640
I'll take you there

21:15.640 --> 21:17.090
to request a Peach Wood Sword that can ward off evil.

21:18.150 --> 21:19.260
There's an academy to the west.

21:19.590 --> 21:20.700
The number one of the world lives there.

21:21.040 --> 21:22.500
I'll take you there to pay him a visit.

21:22.830 --> 21:23.410
Perhaps you can

21:23.670 --> 21:25.060
be his student when the opportunity arises.

21:26.350 --> 21:27.540
Number one?

21:29.080 --> 21:29.700
Father,

21:30.080 --> 21:31.460
I thought you were the number one swordsman in the world.

21:32.520 --> 21:33.330
I may be at the top

21:33.630 --> 21:34.890
of ordinary affairs,

21:35.280 --> 21:36.500
but those who are well-versed in academics

21:36.870 --> 21:38.740
are the best of the best.

21:49.630 --> 21:51.260
Father, you're the best.

21:51.560 --> 21:52.460
- Let's go. - Father, you're the best.

21:52.670 --> 21:53.700
Father, you're great.

22:01.190 --> 22:01.650
Sir,

22:02.430 --> 22:04.130
Su Muyu visited the Thousand-Gold Tower and the academy

22:04.390 --> 22:05.940
after leaving Diaolou Cottage.

22:06.590 --> 22:07.700
However, he didn't enter the academy.

22:08.240 --> 22:10.020
Right now, he's heading toward the Imperial Astronomical Bureau.

22:13.430 --> 22:14.330
There's no need to wait any longer.

22:15.150 --> 22:15.890
Find him.

22:16.480 --> 22:17.650
Bring him to the Shadow Sect.

22:18.040 --> 22:18.540
Yes, sir.

22:32.900 --> 22:39.860
[Imperial Astronomical Bureau]

22:42.340 --> 22:44.700
[Imperial Astronomical Bureau]

22:55.100 --> 22:58.300
[Qi Tianchen, Chancellor]

22:58.320 --> 22:59.780
How dare a filthy member of Blood River

23:00.000 --> 23:02.500
come to cause trouble here?

23:14.620 --> 23:16.620
[Invitation]

23:22.520 --> 23:23.330
An invitation, huh?

23:25.350 --> 23:27.260
Is it an invitation to enter? An invitation to leave?

23:27.590 --> 23:28.300
Or...

23:30.800 --> 23:32.090
Chancellor, please give me a hint.

23:47.870 --> 23:49.330
It seems I'm not welcome here.

23:57.660 --> 24:01.620
[Chaolai Inn]

24:16.080 --> 24:17.460
Mister, what do you need?

24:18.000 --> 24:18.780
Give me a luxury room,

24:19.280 --> 24:20.500
and a table full of dishes and liquor.

24:21.040 --> 24:21.850
I'm hosting a guest.

24:22.190 --> 24:22.780
All right.

24:23.150 --> 24:23.650
Please head upstairs.

24:34.830 --> 24:36.850
The weather is dry!

24:37.190 --> 24:39.370
Beware of fire!

24:42.080 --> 24:42.980
It's very late now.

24:47.960 --> 24:48.890
You've finally arrived.

25:01.000 --> 25:02.020
This is an invitation.

25:05.800 --> 25:07.020
Is this a wedding banquet invitation?

25:10.830 --> 25:12.020
You've only been here for a day,

25:13.040 --> 25:14.540
yet all of the important figures

25:14.560 --> 25:15.300
of Tianqi City

25:15.590 --> 25:16.570
knew about your arrival.

25:17.910 --> 25:18.610
They knew

25:18.630 --> 25:19.610
I was coming.

25:21.830 --> 25:23.410
That's why they don't think it's strange

25:24.320 --> 25:25.740
no matter who comes to find me tonight.

25:26.830 --> 25:27.850
To them,

25:29.320 --> 25:30.610
you're merely

25:30.630 --> 25:31.980
one of those who wanted to know

25:32.870 --> 25:34.740
why I came to Tianqi City.

25:37.520 --> 25:38.370
You're very smart.

25:39.190 --> 25:40.300
To us,

25:41.190 --> 25:42.310
if you show yourself,

25:42.670 --> 25:44.850
we'll be the first to locate you,

25:46.190 --> 25:47.780
for it is us who watch over

25:48.880 --> 25:50.180
the darkness of Tianqi City.

25:51.190 --> 25:52.810
I heard that the swordsmanship of Master Su

25:52.830 --> 25:53.810
was unparalleled.

25:54.830 --> 25:56.220
I practice swordsmanship as well.

25:56.760 --> 25:57.650
I wish to see

25:58.190 --> 25:59.940
your true abilities.

26:11.280 --> 26:12.020
Not everyone has the right

26:13.800 --> 26:15.540
to test my swordsmanship.

26:16.040 --> 26:16.540
At the very least,

26:16.910 --> 26:18.260
you need to wield your sword

26:18.720 --> 26:20.090
in front of me.

26:26.520 --> 26:27.610
So, this is the true capability

26:27.630 --> 26:28.810
of the legendary Umbrella Ghost.

26:29.870 --> 26:30.980
I've finally witnessed it myself.

26:36.500 --> 26:37.700
[Shadow Sect]

26:49.960 --> 26:51.890
The First Guard Division of Tianqi City's Shadow Sect,

26:52.870 --> 26:53.540
Hawkeye.

26:54.480 --> 26:55.850
The one who watches over Blood River from the dark

26:57.280 --> 26:58.170
is the Shadow Sect.

26:58.960 --> 27:00.020
I'm Crow,

27:00.800 --> 27:01.500
leader of Hawkeye.

27:02.080 --> 27:02.890
I'm here to meet you

27:03.390 --> 27:04.090
as per Sir's request.

27:05.190 --> 27:06.650
I've been waiting outside for a long time.

27:08.040 --> 27:09.460
Many people passed by the inn,

27:10.430 --> 27:11.460
yet none of them came upstairs.

27:12.720 --> 27:14.410
It seems the name of Blood River's Umbrella Ghost

27:15.430 --> 27:17.390
still intimidates them.

27:18.390 --> 27:19.980
However, I think it's reasonable for the Shadow Sect

27:20.760 --> 27:22.130
to seek me out.

27:23.080 --> 27:24.220
After all, you guys watch over

27:25.080 --> 27:26.610
the darkness in Tianqi City.

27:27.320 --> 27:28.780
You said you were acting under the sect leader's command.

27:29.830 --> 27:31.460
Is it Yi Bo, the leader of the Shadow Sect?

27:33.080 --> 27:33.850
I dare not address

27:34.870 --> 27:35.700
the sect leader's full name.

27:36.870 --> 27:37.810
He's the master of Luo Qingyang.

27:39.040 --> 27:39.780
I know who he is.

27:40.590 --> 27:41.570
The name of Senior Brother Luo

27:41.570 --> 27:42.420
is already a taboo

27:42.420 --> 27:43.570
in the sect.

27:44.800 --> 27:45.370
Up next is...

27:45.430 --> 27:46.460
That's all for tonight.

27:46.590 --> 27:47.260
What do you mean by this?

27:56.590 --> 27:57.780
Tonight, I merely wish to find out

27:58.520 --> 27:59.940
about your identity.

28:00.350 --> 28:01.300
As for the rest,

28:03.430 --> 28:04.260
we can talk about them tomorrow.

28:14.870 --> 28:15.700
The Shadow Sect, huh?

28:17.800 --> 28:19.130
It seems I need to owe them a favor.

28:27.000 --> 28:28.260
This is already the 13th batch

28:28.280 --> 28:28.980
of assailants.

28:29.590 --> 28:30.410
Someone is trying to impede us

28:30.520 --> 28:31.460
from entering Tianqi.

28:34.960 --> 28:35.810
It's Blood River.

28:36.320 --> 28:37.300
I received new intel.

28:37.420 --> 28:38.060
Su Muyu

28:38.080 --> 28:40.170
has already entered Tianqi alone.

28:40.560 --> 28:42.500
I think he has a goal to achieve

28:43.320 --> 28:44.370
before our arrival.

28:46.240 --> 28:47.170
I told you guys long ago.

28:48.670 --> 28:49.940
We shouldn't underestimate Blood River.

28:50.760 --> 28:51.980
I've engaged Su Changhe and Su Muyu

28:52.520 --> 28:53.610
in battle before.

28:54.110 --> 28:56.020
They are outstanding young individuals.

28:57.150 --> 28:58.300
If it's possible,

28:58.960 --> 29:00.260
I hope

29:01.590 --> 29:03.260
that they can become our companions.

29:07.800 --> 29:08.570
Water Official,

29:09.720 --> 29:11.020
what do you mean by that?

29:13.110 --> 29:14.090
Tianqi City's Shadow Sect

29:14.150 --> 29:15.090
had already fallen from grace.

29:15.670 --> 29:16.540
But the current Blood River

29:16.560 --> 29:17.890
is filled with hope, don't you agree?

29:18.280 --> 29:18.940
Such foolishness.

29:19.520 --> 29:20.850
Blood River is merely a killing tool

29:20.870 --> 29:22.410
meant for other people to wield.

29:23.520 --> 29:24.130
Enough.

29:24.960 --> 29:25.740
We should make haste.

29:26.320 --> 29:27.020
From now on,

29:27.560 --> 29:28.890
do not utter such preposterous words

29:29.350 --> 29:30.130
again.

29:36.910 --> 29:38.370
They didn't want to be the Umbrella Ghost

29:38.480 --> 29:39.500
and the Undertaker.

29:40.240 --> 29:42.130
They merely want to be themselves.

29:43.910 --> 29:45.410
Actually, I'm the same.

29:47.910 --> 29:50.330
I only wish to be Su Henshui,

29:51.910 --> 29:52.980
not the Water Official.

30:04.800 --> 30:05.850
Whose letter is this?

30:08.320 --> 30:09.260
It's from your favorite Su Muyu.

30:10.040 --> 30:11.020
He wants me to complete a request.

30:24.720 --> 30:25.780
You guys said you would arrive on the second day.

30:28.080 --> 30:29.060
I've been waiting for a few days.

30:34.110 --> 30:35.500
You guys were the one who decided on that date.

30:36.670 --> 30:38.170
We will come anytime

30:38.800 --> 30:39.850
we like.

30:40.830 --> 30:41.700
Sect Leader is inviting you

30:42.520 --> 30:43.610
to a banquet that will be held in three days.

30:44.480 --> 30:45.300
Attend it in secret.

30:46.560 --> 30:48.260
Do not let anyone find out.

31:11.390 --> 31:11.980
Sir,

31:12.720 --> 31:13.740
why did you bring me here?

31:15.320 --> 31:16.090
Are we here

31:16.630 --> 31:18.260
to retrieve the treasures in Yellow Springs Pawnshop?

31:19.350 --> 31:20.260
I'm bringing you to see someone.

31:22.560 --> 31:23.370
Who is it?

31:25.240 --> 31:26.020
The Ferryman.

31:30.320 --> 31:31.410
Mister, you've returned.

31:31.760 --> 31:32.410
Hongying,

31:32.960 --> 31:34.090
you ferry people every day.

31:34.480 --> 31:35.850
How much is Yellow Springs Pawnshop paying you?

31:38.670 --> 31:39.460
Mister,

31:39.800 --> 31:41.650
to think that you still remember my name.

31:44.190 --> 31:45.850
I ferry people here every day

31:47.000 --> 31:47.850
without charging a single cent.

31:49.150 --> 31:50.980
I'm merely waiting for my destined one to come.

31:51.430 --> 31:52.460
If so, can the guy beside me

31:53.000 --> 31:54.260
be your destined one, then?

31:56.560 --> 31:58.020
I...

31:58.590 --> 31:59.300
Sir,

31:59.830 --> 32:01.130
are you going to sell me off?

32:03.240 --> 32:04.700
Mister, do you know

32:05.430 --> 32:07.220
what I meant when I uttered the phrase

32:07.800 --> 32:08.940
"destined one"?

32:09.870 --> 32:10.850
Your name is Hongying.

32:11.760 --> 32:13.410
The surname Hong is very rare.

32:14.430 --> 32:15.460
Is that your surname?

32:17.670 --> 32:18.300
I do not have

32:19.110 --> 32:20.300
a surname.

32:21.240 --> 32:22.500
From today onward, you shall have one.

32:23.480 --> 32:24.370
Your surname will be Mu.

32:26.830 --> 32:28.020
He's the head of the Mu family.

32:29.040 --> 32:30.220
That's what I meant by saying that he's your destined one.

32:33.480 --> 32:35.170
Patriarch of Blood River,

32:35.760 --> 32:38.570
are you trying to steal one of my men?

32:39.320 --> 32:40.610
You can pick and choose

32:40.900 --> 32:41.770
any items in the room

32:41.770 --> 32:42.980
that will amount to the same value as her.

32:43.480 --> 32:44.220
But now,

32:44.720 --> 32:45.500
Hongying is mine.

32:46.350 --> 32:47.300
The token they gave you

32:47.560 --> 32:48.220
was a fake.

32:48.560 --> 32:49.170
The Shadow Sect

32:49.590 --> 32:50.940
has the real deal.

32:54.040 --> 32:55.060
If so, I will owe you for now.

32:55.670 --> 32:56.980
You may choose your items

32:57.760 --> 32:58.940
once I retrieve the token.

32:59.590 --> 33:00.780
It's a deal.

33:05.170 --> 33:05.740
Miss,

33:06.350 --> 33:07.130
from today onward,

33:07.830 --> 33:09.060
you're a member of the Mu family.

33:11.980 --> 33:13.820
[Zhe]

33:19.000 --> 33:20.220
It turns out that the enemy of Shadow Sect

33:20.430 --> 33:21.850
is Xiao Ruofeng, the Prince of Langya.

33:22.240 --> 33:24.090
The Four Guardians of Tianqi City and the Inner Security Division,

33:24.430 --> 33:25.220
which were founded by him,

33:25.390 --> 33:26.810
robbed Shadow Sect of their power.

33:27.350 --> 33:28.460
Therefore, they gave

33:28.520 --> 33:29.890
the Three Officials an order.

33:30.320 --> 33:31.090
They instructed the Patriarch

33:31.240 --> 33:33.300
to deal with Second Master Tang

33:33.830 --> 33:35.260
to lure Tang Lianyue

33:35.320 --> 33:36.260
out of Tianqi City.

33:36.630 --> 33:37.610
After that, they used us

33:37.800 --> 33:38.890
to get rid of Tang Lianyue,

33:39.280 --> 33:41.060
eliminating a powerful foe of theirs in the process.

33:41.480 --> 33:43.090
This muddy affair in Tianqi City

33:44.430 --> 33:45.940
is much more troublesome than I thought.

33:51.430 --> 33:52.370
Given your identity,

33:53.350 --> 33:55.170
you had to slip away from that place day after day.

33:56.350 --> 33:57.370
Aren't you afraid that the Prince of Langya

33:57.560 --> 33:59.220
might find out about you?

34:00.000 --> 34:01.850
Many people knew

34:02.520 --> 34:04.570
that I wasn't willing to remain at the imperial mausoleum.

34:05.240 --> 34:06.330
If I kept watch

34:06.350 --> 34:07.700
over the mausoleum

34:07.720 --> 34:09.060
without doing anything,

34:09.520 --> 34:10.290
I assume

34:10.840 --> 34:12.690
[Zhuo Qing, Former Great Eunuch]
they need to be worried about that.

34:14.110 --> 34:15.020
Speaking of which,

34:15.790 --> 34:16.420
Sect Leader,

34:17.190 --> 34:18.290
how's that pledge of loyalty

34:18.590 --> 34:19.900
coming lately?

34:20.190 --> 34:21.730
Just tell First Prince

34:21.920 --> 34:22.770
to enjoy the show.

34:23.190 --> 34:24.980
I will use Blood River

34:25.440 --> 34:26.460
to eliminate

34:26.520 --> 34:28.060
our common foe.

34:29.820 --> 34:30.820
Excellent.

34:31.590 --> 34:36.380
It's good that you're confident.

34:37.560 --> 34:41.060
When will we meet the Umbrella Ghost?

34:41.110 --> 34:42.090
He will attend the banquet

34:43.750 --> 34:44.940
in three days.

34:45.790 --> 34:49.420
If so, the sword qi that's approaching us,

34:49.670 --> 34:51.690
who does it belong to?

34:57.880 --> 34:59.610
He has an immense sword qi,

35:00.360 --> 35:02.460
yet his killing intent is well-hidden.

35:03.150 --> 35:05.170
A ferocious sword

35:05.590 --> 35:06.610
that will devour its wielder

35:06.630 --> 35:09.130
if he doesn't keep it in check...

35:10.750 --> 35:11.250
Su Muyu!

35:11.710 --> 35:12.290
How dare you?

35:18.230 --> 35:19.500
So, you are Su Muyu.

35:20.400 --> 35:21.090
Excellent.

35:22.150 --> 35:23.570
We were supposed to meet in three days.

35:24.110 --> 35:25.290
But you're here today.

35:27.110 --> 35:27.690
Why is that the case?

35:29.440 --> 35:30.340
The goal of this trip

35:31.750 --> 35:33.210
wasn't to let Shadow Sect seek out Blood River.

35:33.880 --> 35:35.460
It's the opposite.

35:36.400 --> 35:37.570
You wish to meet me in three days.

35:38.360 --> 35:38.900
However, I wish to meet you

35:39.400 --> 35:40.540
today.

35:41.150 --> 35:43.090
You're quite different from the tales

35:43.960 --> 35:44.610
I've heard about you.

35:45.360 --> 35:46.940
Care to explain yourself?

35:47.480 --> 35:48.770
Rumor has it that Su Muyu

35:49.880 --> 35:51.130
resembled a swordsman

35:51.750 --> 35:52.980
more than an assassin.

35:54.040 --> 35:54.980
He had a gentle personality,

35:55.480 --> 35:56.500
and he treated everyone with respect.

35:57.310 --> 35:58.500
But when you came,

35:59.080 --> 36:00.020
you drew your sword.

36:00.560 --> 36:01.210
When you spoke,

36:02.480 --> 36:04.210
you wanted to rob the host of his power.

36:05.630 --> 36:07.210
Now, there are no longer any assassins left in Blood River.

36:08.790 --> 36:09.900
As the head of the Su family,

36:10.750 --> 36:12.170
I have to adopt a stronger attitude.

36:13.310 --> 36:15.250
However, Sect Leader Yi, this is your residence after all.

36:16.150 --> 36:17.020
I'm a guest.

36:17.880 --> 36:18.610
It's indeed rude of me

36:19.080 --> 36:20.130
to show up unannounced.

36:21.190 --> 36:22.290
If you don't welcome me,

36:23.520 --> 36:24.570
I can leave right now.

36:25.040 --> 36:26.210
In three days,

36:27.480 --> 36:28.250
you would've been able to enjoy

36:28.480 --> 36:30.610
the Jiantian Feast prepared by Zhaiyue Restaurant.

36:31.480 --> 36:32.170
What a shame.

36:33.360 --> 36:34.020
Since

36:34.960 --> 36:36.020
you're already here,

36:37.270 --> 36:38.730
I have to host you somehow.

36:39.110 --> 36:39.610
Crow.

36:39.920 --> 36:40.380
Yes, sir.

36:40.880 --> 36:41.690
Tell the kitchen

36:41.840 --> 36:42.770
to prepare some dishes for us.

36:43.630 --> 36:44.900
I need to have a chat

36:45.920 --> 36:46.610
with Master Su.

36:47.310 --> 36:48.020
Thank you.

36:54.630 --> 36:55.170
Come.

36:56.110 --> 36:56.610
Mr. Su,

36:56.840 --> 36:57.290
please.

37:03.440 --> 37:05.170
Mr. Su, I'm sure you're still perplexed.

37:05.670 --> 37:06.770
Blood River and Shadow Sect

37:07.080 --> 37:08.610
weren't related from the start.

37:09.480 --> 37:10.020
However,

37:10.110 --> 37:11.420
now, it seems

37:11.670 --> 37:14.210
we're bound by countless invisible threads.

37:16.480 --> 37:17.340
Soul Reapers' Hall

37:17.790 --> 37:19.210
was the one that assigned all missions to Blood River.

37:19.750 --> 37:20.780
We always thought

37:20.920 --> 37:23.030
that someone in the martial world put a huge bounty on their targets

37:23.230 --> 37:25.170
and hired Soul Reapers' Hall to put a hit on them.

37:26.440 --> 37:28.420
I never expected Shadow Sect to be the one assigning our missions to us.

37:30.190 --> 37:31.900
Speaking of that,

37:32.480 --> 37:33.980
we need to trace back to the time

37:34.480 --> 37:35.900
when Beili had first established its own state.

37:37.080 --> 37:38.130
This is

37:38.880 --> 37:40.420
a long stretch of history.

37:40.660 --> 37:45.340
[Yi's Residence]

37:48.040 --> 37:50.170
However, Su Changhe and I, who lead

37:50.880 --> 37:51.460
the current Blood River,

37:52.230 --> 37:53.860
have nothing to do

37:55.000 --> 37:56.380
with the Shadow Guards that existed centuries ago.

37:57.000 --> 37:57.570
I know.

37:59.080 --> 38:00.060
You guys are Nameless.

38:00.560 --> 38:01.340
You two aren't connected

38:01.920 --> 38:03.420
to the lineage of Blood River.

38:03.920 --> 38:04.540
You're wrong.

38:06.880 --> 38:07.690
The current Blood River

38:08.880 --> 38:10.380
is a true family.

38:11.110 --> 38:12.980
And, we will choose our own paths.

38:17.190 --> 38:19.170
You guys are too young.

38:20.230 --> 38:21.770
It seems you guys don't know anything.

38:22.520 --> 38:23.210
For example,

38:24.960 --> 38:25.860
Wanjuan Tower.

38:26.440 --> 38:27.340
Wanjuan Tower?

38:27.840 --> 38:28.250
That's right.

38:28.880 --> 38:30.020
Wanjuan Tower.

38:31.520 --> 38:33.540
For the past few centuries,

38:33.920 --> 38:35.570
Blood River was under Shadow Sect.

38:36.400 --> 38:38.090
The address of Blood River,

38:38.440 --> 38:40.210
which ordinary people could never locate,

38:40.920 --> 38:43.020
Spider's Nests that were spread throughout

38:43.400 --> 38:44.940
the world,

38:45.560 --> 38:48.250
your true identities,

38:49.630 --> 38:51.980
the martial arts you use, your weaknesses,

38:52.560 --> 38:53.650
and your portraits

38:54.590 --> 38:56.500
were all kept within the Shadow Sect.

38:57.750 --> 38:58.820
If you attempt to betray us,

38:59.590 --> 39:00.570
all this information

39:00.960 --> 39:03.020
will surface in the martial world.

39:03.670 --> 39:06.060
You all are assassins who've slain countless people.

39:07.400 --> 39:08.340
When we look around,

39:08.840 --> 39:09.780
the martial world

39:09.780 --> 39:11.420
is filled with your sworn enemies.

39:12.630 --> 39:13.540
By that time,

39:14.840 --> 39:15.500
all of you

39:15.840 --> 39:17.980
will be hunted down.

39:26.360 --> 39:27.170
I know.

39:27.920 --> 39:29.340
You guys will surely think

39:30.520 --> 39:31.690
that the current Shadow Sect

39:32.310 --> 39:33.290
only has an empty reputation

39:33.560 --> 39:34.730
of an organization led by the emperor's father-in-law.

39:35.840 --> 39:37.420
You think that we had fallen from grace

39:37.840 --> 39:39.770
in Tianqi City.

39:40.110 --> 39:41.420
You think that we're even inferior to Blood River.

39:41.960 --> 39:43.090
What gives us the right

39:43.230 --> 39:45.130
to be the master of Blood River?

39:47.630 --> 39:48.570
However,

39:49.440 --> 39:51.020
as long as I'm willing,

39:52.590 --> 39:54.860
I can eradicate Blood River.

39:57.960 --> 39:59.900
You guys wish to establish a new Blood River

40:00.480 --> 40:02.060
and start from scratch.

40:03.480 --> 40:04.420
You see,

40:06.000 --> 40:08.500
it's good for youngsters to have lofty aspirations.

40:10.400 --> 40:11.460
But sometimes,

40:12.480 --> 40:13.900
they should stop

40:15.400 --> 40:17.340
and assess their abilities first.

40:18.380 --> 40:19.200
Do you guys truly think

40:19.200 --> 40:20.690
that you can resist the years of control

40:21.750 --> 40:22.770
of the Shadow Sect

40:23.710 --> 40:25.940
with the likes of you?

40:29.880 --> 40:31.340
Tell me your condition.

40:46.040 --> 40:47.940
I allowed you guys to come to Tianqi City

40:48.590 --> 40:50.690
because I needed you all to kill someone for me.

40:53.230 --> 40:53.900
Who is it?

40:55.360 --> 40:56.460
The Prince of Langya,

40:57.670 --> 40:59.060
Xiao Ruofeng.

41:06.040 --> 41:07.500
Blood River is the shadow that handles the martial world

41:07.560 --> 41:09.090
on the Xiao imperial line's behalf.

41:09.920 --> 41:10.770
The Shadow Sect

41:11.480 --> 41:12.570
is the shadow that protects Tianqi City

41:12.590 --> 41:13.900
in the dark.

41:14.590 --> 41:15.980
If so, what happens in Tianqi City

41:16.840 --> 41:18.130
should be unrelated to Blood River.

41:19.040 --> 41:20.940
The Prince of Langya is a member of the Xiao imperial line.

41:21.630 --> 41:22.540
Assassinating him

41:24.190 --> 41:26.170
would mean going against the beliefs of both organizations.

41:27.080 --> 41:29.090
This isn't the duty of Shadow Sect.

41:29.710 --> 41:31.540
You're just doing this for your own desire.

41:35.190 --> 41:36.130
Since that's the case,

41:37.230 --> 41:38.940
you must offer something in exchange.

41:39.630 --> 41:40.570
What do you

41:40.920 --> 41:41.770
desire?

41:42.630 --> 41:44.020
Everything you said just now

41:44.480 --> 41:45.690
must vanish

41:45.750 --> 41:46.940
from the world entirely.

41:47.310 --> 41:48.090
From now on, Blood River

41:48.150 --> 41:49.860
and Shadow Sect will be unrelated.

41:57.520 --> 41:58.690
It seems

41:59.310 --> 42:00.900
that's the end of our negotiation.

42:01.920 --> 42:02.610
Crow,

42:03.270 --> 42:04.170
see our guest off.

42:17.880 --> 42:19.460
Sir, you know the best

42:20.270 --> 42:21.130
about the task

42:21.190 --> 42:22.690
you wish to assign to us.

42:34.040 --> 42:36.250
The Prince of Langya has the most military strength in Beili.

42:36.670 --> 42:37.610
Even the emperor

42:38.590 --> 42:40.170
has to show him respect in the imperial court.

42:40.840 --> 42:41.650
In the martial world,

42:42.270 --> 42:43.420
he's known as the senior brother of Baili Dongjun,

42:43.560 --> 42:44.980
the lord of Xueyue City.

42:46.880 --> 42:47.610
If I kill him,

42:48.440 --> 42:49.980
I'll offend the entire world.

42:57.880 --> 42:58.900
I don't think

43:00.080 --> 43:01.900
you have the right to negotiate a deal with me.

43:15.040 --> 43:16.380
If word of Blood River spreads

43:16.520 --> 43:17.730
across the jianghu,

43:18.790 --> 43:20.340
then we, with nowhere to go,

43:21.480 --> 43:22.540
will make Tianqi City

43:22.630 --> 43:23.980
our first stop.

43:25.750 --> 43:27.540
Maybe the world won't have us,

43:28.790 --> 43:30.060
but we'll...

43:31.440 --> 43:33.980
erase the Shadow Sect from this world.

43:37.340 --> 43:40.820
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

43:40.860 --> 43:44.740
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

43:46.580 --> 43:50.060
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

43:50.100 --> 43:53.940
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

43:55.940 --> 43:59.220
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

43:59.340 --> 44:01.420
♪Still I can't let go♪

44:01.580 --> 44:05.020
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

44:05.500 --> 44:07.700
♪My heart no longer my own♪

44:07.820 --> 44:12.820
♪No one can escape from love♪

44:29.420 --> 44:33.140
♪How many hidden feelings♪

44:33.260 --> 44:37.340
♪Sink in silence deep?♪

44:38.580 --> 44:42.460
♪Searching through the endless nights♪

44:42.580 --> 44:46.820
♪Struggling on the edge of love and pain♪

44:47.940 --> 44:50.820
♪Shadows crossing shadows♪

44:50.900 --> 44:55.140
♪Whose name hides in your eyes?♪

44:57.420 --> 45:01.420
♪When the wind blows, ask not when I shall return♪

45:01.460 --> 45:04.900
♪Ask not when I shall return♪

